 {title:'4. Query the top-level-domain DNS',short:'TLD query + referral',who:'Recursive resolver and .com TLD server',text:'The resolver sends the same question to a .com TLD server. The TLD server returns a referral to the authoritative name servers for example.com.',pair:'Iterative referral'},
